  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The velocity of a projectile at the initial point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Its velocity (in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>) at point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/37ddd8a8-ec7d-4555-bea7-f806e51fc14e-image.png\" style=\"width: 190px; height: 183px;\" /></p>",
